(2605339, 360253, 30861, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately he''s not hanging 10, he''s falling off his board. When a surfer "hangs 10", which they rarely do anymore, he is standing on the very nose of his board with all 10 toes right up at or over the edge, ya know? It''s a longboard thing, you can''t even do it with a little board like this.<br/> <br/>But I''m sure 90% of DPCers won''t know this, and it''s a very nice capture :-)</td>', 'Unfortunately he''s not hanging 10, he''s falling off his board. When a surfer "hangs 10", which they rarely do anymore, he is standing on the very nose of his board with all 10 toes right up at or over the edge, ya know? It''s a longboard thing, you can''t even do it with a little board like this. But I''m sure 90% of DPCers won''t know this, and it''s a very nice capture :-)', '2006-07-10 01:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
