(2605552, 360998, 39880, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W shot.  I like the simpleness of it.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice B&W shot.  I like the simpleness of it.  Well done.', '2006-07-10 02:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605554, 360587, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp macro.  I like the reflection.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice and sharp macro.  I like the reflection.  Well done.', '2006-07-10 02:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605559, 361032, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, though the left side looks like it is a bit darker than then right.  The electronic dealy has an interest to it with all its gadgetry but I think the image could be stronger if you had done something more to the composition, added more than just light to what was already there. 4</td>', 'Good lighting, though the left side looks like it is a bit darker than then right.  The electronic dealy has an interest to it with all its gadgetry but I think the image could be stronger if you had done something more to the composition, added more than just light to what was already there. 4', '2006-07-10 02:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605574, 361231, 29177, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far! Very original and well shot! Good Luck!</td>', 'My favorite so far! Very original and well shot! Good Luck!', '2006-07-10 02:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605580, 360895, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good use of natural lighting.  I also like the way the coloring has come out.  The composition isn''t very inspiring, seems a little unbalanced.  The image also feels a little oversharpened but the over-sharp nature does work for the image - coupled with the interesting color tone (sort of a light weathered tone) it gives the image an almost surreal look, not entirely but it gets close.  5</td>', 'Good use of natural lighting.  I also like the way the coloring has come out.  The composition isn''t very inspiring, seems a little unbalanced.  The image also feels a little oversharpened but the over-sharp nature does work for the image - coupled with the interesting color tone (sort of a light weathered tone) it gives the image an almost surreal look, not entirely but it gets close.  5', '2006-07-10 02:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605585, 361286, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh.  Nice frogs.  Sharpness looks good.  I like the contrast between the background and the frog coloring.  I like the concept for this image but there''s just something about it that doesn''t draw me in.  I''m not sure if its the composition or what.  5</td>', 'Heh.  Nice frogs.  Sharpness looks good.  I like the contrast between the background and the frog coloring.  I like the concept for this image but there''s just something about it that doesn''t draw me in.  I''m not sure if its the composition or what.  5', '2006-07-10 02:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605587, 361134, 56880, '<td valign="top">Very nice limited focus!</td>', 'Very nice limited focus!', '2006-07-10 02:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605592, 361345, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image, very good clarity, lovely lighting - though I wish the apple had a bit better lighting so instead of merely reflecting the light for the most part and getting its shape lost in shadow, it was highlighted a bit more, especially since it adds the only pop of color.  I think the composition is perfect.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Nice simple image, very good clarity, lovely lighting - though I wish the apple had a bit better lighting so instead of merely reflecting the light for the most part and getting its shape lost in shadow, it was highlighted a bit more, especially since it adds the only pop of color.  I think the composition is perfect.  Well done.  7', '2006-07-10 02:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605594, 360755, 34763, '<td valign="top">What a great photo, just really enjoy looking at it, the contrast and sharpness are perfect. As a photo it rates 10 but without the title it just doesn''t scream the number 10 or ten anythings. Hope the best for it and you.</td>', 'What a great photo, just really enjoy looking at it, the contrast and sharpness are perfect. As a photo it rates 10 but without the title it just doesn''t scream the number 10 or ten anythings. Hope the best for it and you.', '2006-07-10 02:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605597, 359957, 56880, '<td valign="top">Ha! and the cheerios are a nice touch.</td>', 'Ha! and the cheerios are a nice touch.', '2006-07-10 02:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605598, 358400, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity.  Nice composition and very wonderfully rendered.  I like the grunge look - the dark/dirty hands really draws out the details in them.  Lighting is wonderful.  Nothing I would change at all.  Very nicely done. 10</td>', 'Excellent clarity.  Nice composition and very wonderfully rendered.  I like the grunge look - the dark/dirty hands really draws out the details in them.  Lighting is wonderful.  Nothing I would change at all.  Very nicely done. 10', '2006-07-10 02:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605600, 361256, 34763, '<td valign="top">cute, maybe ewith baby hands and feet and softer look would help.</td>', 'cute, maybe ewith baby hands and feet and softer look would help.', '2006-07-10 02:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605607, 360281, 34763, '<td valign="top">This has got to be one of the most touching photos on DPC, a ribbon for sure. Well done!!</td>', 'This has got to be one of the most touching photos on DPC, a ribbon for sure. Well done!!', '2006-07-10 02:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605610, 358400, 34763, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and setup. Grunge has a neat effect but other than making their hands look dirty what does it add? Great idea.</td>', 'Like the idea and setup. Grunge has a neat effect but other than making their hands look dirty what does it add? Great idea.', '2006-07-10 02:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605615, 359690, 46193, '<td valign="top">Nice picture! Love the misting clouds and the contrast colors!</td>', 'Nice picture! Love the misting clouds and the contrast colors!', '2006-07-10 02:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2605623, 359955, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I love the beetle, its gorgeous.  I wish it was a bit more prominant with all its colorful interest.  The concept is great, fits the challenge very nicely.  Lighting is well done. It lakes just a little something that would give it a nice finished look, but I think it is just great.  6</td>', 'Very cute!  I love the beetle, its gorgeous.  I wish it was a bit more prominant with all its colorful interest.  The concept is great, fits the challenge very nicely.  Lighting is well done. It lakes just a little something that would give it a nice finished look, but I think it is just great.  6', '2006-07-10 02:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
