(2606217, 360176, 54778, '<td valign="top">Aww.. I think you''ll get all the votes because of the cuteness factor..<br/>How in the world did you manage to get a pic of these darned things. They always scamper off before you can click. <br/>I do believe you could have gone a bit adventurous with the editing in this since this ''is'' the advanced editing challenge. Maybe selectively saturate by keeping the colour of the flowers and filtering the rest to brown or something.<br/>Anyway good shot!</td>', 'Aww.. I think you''ll get all the votes because of the cuteness factor..How in the world did you manage to get a pic of these darned things. They always scamper off before you can click. I do believe you could have gone a bit adventurous with the editing in this since this ''is'' the advanced editing challenge. Maybe selectively saturate by keeping the colour of the flowers and filtering the rest to brown or something.Anyway good shot!', '2006-07-10 07:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
