(2606484, 361087, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever. I like the fish eye lens too. Usually, I hate centered images, but this is impactful and works.</td>', 'Clever. I like the fish eye lens too. Usually, I hate centered images, but this is impactful and works.', '2006-07-10 09:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606493, 361286, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEEEE.  How did you get that many frogs?  Not crazy about the red background, I think a black or white one would have served you better.  BUT having said that, at least you used a little imagination and this isn''t fingers or toes.  HA!</td>', 'HEEEE.  How did you get that many frogs?  Not crazy about the red background, I think a black or white one would have served you better.  BUT having said that, at least you used a little imagination and this isn''t fingers or toes.  HA!', '2006-07-10 09:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606496, 360197, 15711, '<td valign="top">I thought of the exact same thing, but didn''t have any. Wow, you even have the sunset!!  Pretty clever.</td>', 'I thought of the exact same thing, but didn''t have any. Wow, you even have the sunset!!  Pretty clever.', '2006-07-10 09:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606501, 361011, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the saturation of the bus only.  Nice use of the fish eye.</td>', 'I like the saturation of the bus only.  Nice use of the fish eye.', '2006-07-10 09:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606505, 360871, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this, but I wish we were at the same level as the animals and not looking down on them.</td>', 'I love the idea of this, but I wish we were at the same level as the animals and not looking down on them.', '2006-07-10 09:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606506, 357578, 15711, '<td valign="top">I usually hate clock pictures, but for some reason, the graphics of this works.  I like the slight tilt of it, as well as the red.  That''s probably what did it for me cause it''s my favorite color. 7</td>', 'I usually hate clock pictures, but for some reason, the graphics of this works.  I like the slight tilt of it, as well as the red.  That''s probably what did it for me cause it''s my favorite color. 7', '2006-07-10 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606512, 361304, 15711, '<td valign="top">Something about this made me smile. ROFL  I can imagine what he''s thinking ("can I get up now?") I think it would have been so much more effective had you not cropped it so tightly, and had more negative space to one side, so he isn''t bulls eye centered. I like the idea though. I''d get down on the floor level with the camera and shoot up his body instead of peering down on him.</td>', 'Something about this made me smile. ROFL  I can imagine what he''s thinking ("can I get up now?") I think it would have been so much more effective had you not cropped it so tightly, and had more negative space to one side, so he isn''t bulls eye centered. I like the idea though. I''d get down on the floor level with the camera and shoot up his body instead of peering down on him.', '2006-07-10 09:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606513, 360859, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a nostalgic sense to it. I like the overall tones. It isn''t tack sharp, yet it works. I might have done some burn around the bird''s eyes and feathers for a bit more variation and textural difference. 7</td>', 'This has a nostalgic sense to it. I like the overall tones. It isn''t tack sharp, yet it works. I might have done some burn around the bird''s eyes and feathers for a bit more variation and textural difference. 7', '2006-07-10 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606516, 359952, 15711, '<td valign="top">Just stunning. I think my favorite of the challenge. Simple yet effective. They look like glistening drops of mercury. Love the detail of the veins. 10</td>', 'Just stunning. I think my favorite of the challenge. Simple yet effective. They look like glistening drops of mercury. Love the detail of the veins. 10', '2006-07-10 09:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
