(2607629, 358823, 47704, '<td valign="top">This is the most imaginative pic yet.  I really want to give it a good score but I''m a little confused by some of the blur.  I don''t know if it motion blur or something you did.  I have a feeling it''s something you did.  However, I will give more points because you took a shot that is actually creative, not a coin, dice, or some stupid pic with jellybeans!! 7<br/> <br/>I think I could have gone to a 9 without the blur.  Sorry!!</td>', 'This is the most imaginative pic yet.  I really want to give it a good score but I''m a little confused by some of the blur.  I don''t know if it motion blur or something you did.  I have a feeling it''s something you did.  However, I will give more points because you took a shot that is actually creative, not a coin, dice, or some stupid pic with jellybeans!! 7 I think I could have gone to a 9 without the blur.  Sorry!!', '2006-07-10 15:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
