(2607730, 359648, 47704, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m sorry but there are just no redeeming qualities in this pic.  It''s cropped badly, the lighting is horrible, and it looks like a vacation photo.  Sorry to be so harsh.  1</td>', 'Wow, I''m sorry but there are just no redeeming qualities in this pic.  It''s cropped badly, the lighting is horrible, and it looks like a vacation photo.  Sorry to be so harsh.  1', '2006-07-10 16:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
