(2608933, 360421, 24454, '<td valign="top">Eeeeeee. . .this is a hard vote because it is a beeeeautiful photo!!!  And one that certainly tugs at my heart -- being the psycho animal lover that I am -- buuuttttttttt. . . .the 10 thing.   I don''t know.   It seems to be a bit of a stretch.    Ok, I''ll vote with my heart and give it the benefit of the doubt :)  It really is an awesome photo!!!!</td>', 'Eeeeeee. . .this is a hard vote because it is a beeeeautiful photo!!!  And one that certainly tugs at my heart -- being the psycho animal lover that I am -- buuuttttttttt. . . .the 10 thing.   I don''t know.   It seems to be a bit of a stretch.    Ok, I''ll vote with my heart and give it the benefit of the doubt :)  It really is an awesome photo!!!!', '2006-07-10 22:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608940, 361039, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   That certainly is a "10" sunset!    Gorgeous!</td>', 'Wow!   That certainly is a "10" sunset!    Gorgeous!', '2006-07-10 22:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
