(2608946, 360709, 24454, '<td valign="top">And 10 fingers to cover your bases for the dnmc police, right?  :)   I love this photo!!!   It''s as sweet a 10 as I ever saw!!!!!    Good luck!!</td>', 'And 10 fingers to cover your bases for the dnmc police, right?  :)   I love this photo!!!   It''s as sweet a 10 as I ever saw!!!!!    Good luck!!', '2006-07-10 22:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608950, 361220, 24454, '<td valign="top">Now, this is a good one!!!   Great idea, and very well executed!</td>', 'Now, this is a good one!!!   Great idea, and very well executed!', '2006-07-10 22:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608953, 361231, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a patient little model you have here... a creative idea, and a cute little bunny for that extra bump of a point.  If I had to find something to improve with this shot, it would be the little spots of fur that seem to be a bit overexposed.  Nicely done!</td>', 'What a patient little model you have here... a creative idea, and a cute little bunny for that extra bump of a point.  If I had to find something to improve with this shot, it would be the little spots of fur that seem to be a bit overexposed.  Nicely done!', '2006-07-10 22:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608968, 360587, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great comp, reflection and superb details. The contrast and tones really polish this off quite nicely. Well done :)</td>', 'Great comp, reflection and superb details. The contrast and tones really polish this off quite nicely. Well done :)', '2006-07-10 22:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608974, 361056, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice one... I like your take on this challenge. Very well thought out and executed. Strong composition and superb tonal range :)</td>', 'Nice one... I like your take on this challenge. Very well thought out and executed. Strong composition and superb tonal range :)', '2006-07-10 22:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608986, 360588, 45475, '<td valign="top">salivating... :) Great use of what appears to be late afternoon sun, does wonders for the orange here. A killer crop too! Well done.</td>', 'salivating... :) Great use of what appears to be late afternoon sun, does wonders for the orange here. A killer crop too! Well done.', '2006-07-10 22:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608988, 361011, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this one alot.  I love the interesting angle, and the urban look to the street.  Good job!</td>', 'I like this one alot.  I love the interesting angle, and the urban look to the street.  Good job!', '2006-07-10 22:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2608990, 359974, 45475, '<td valign="top">Mad! This totally rocks! Pure genius...</td>', 'Mad! This totally rocks! Pure genius...', '2006-07-10 22:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
