(2609010, 360755, 45475, '<td valign="top">I never get tired of seeing sports action shots like these. I think they''re indicative of the skill of the photographer. A second in time that becomes unforgettable once seen. Well timed and more importantly, captured... even the border compliments :)</td>', 'I never get tired of seeing sports action shots like these. I think they''re indicative of the skill of the photographer. A second in time that becomes unforgettable once seen. Well timed and more importantly, captured... even the border compliments :)', '2006-07-10 23:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609011, 361134, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, and love the shallow dof too.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice action shot, and love the shallow dof too.  Well done!', '2006-07-10 23:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609026, 359829, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, nicely done. Love the golden colours in the seascape, which imo, looks like a ripper in its own right. Good work with this original piece - 9 :)</td>', 'Oh yeah, nicely done. Love the golden colours in the seascape, which imo, looks like a ripper in its own right. Good work with this original piece - 9 :)', '2006-07-10 23:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
