(2609413, 360819, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... not sure you had any feathering around your selection. Did you try to selectively darken the background or did you drop another one in? And what on earth did you do to the whites of their eyes! LOL! I''m going to assume that this is all intentional for the sake of humour :D:D</td>', 'Hmmmm... not sure you had any feathering around your selection. Did you try to selectively darken the background or did you drop another one in? And what on earth did you do to the whites of their eyes! LOL! I''m going to assume that this is all intentional for the sake of humour :D:D', '2006-07-11 00:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
