(2609457, 361305, 45475, '<td valign="top">I struggle to find a reason for the sepia here, particularly as it has dulled the tonal range somewhat. Compositionally, it''s fine. However the sky seems to let the scene down a bit. My quick fix for something like that would be to add a gradient fill layer (top down, overlay mode, reduced opacity) and then mask the bottom 2/3rds (foreground to transparent). Just a thought :) Best wishes for the challenge.</td>', 'I struggle to find a reason for the sepia here, particularly as it has dulled the tonal range somewhat. Compositionally, it''s fine. However the sky seems to let the scene down a bit. My quick fix for something like that would be to add a gradient fill layer (top down, overlay mode, reduced opacity) and then mask the bottom 2/3rds (foreground to transparent). Just a thought :) Best wishes for the challenge.', '2006-07-11 00:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
