(2609515, 359265, 22301, '<td valign="top">my guess is this was taken with a D70s with a Sigma 10-20mm f/4-5.6 EX DC HSM for Nikon and from the clouds in the sky and the diffused light it looks to be taken in Niagara Falls Canada. I think I can hear a couple brothers somewhere around too. <br/>I played with this in photoshop alittle bit and put the notes in the comments on the image. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=361873" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22301/thumb/361873.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22301/thumb/361873.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22301/thumb/361873.jpg"/></a> <br/>If you want me to take the image down let me know. Oh yeah and if I was completely wrong, ummm oops.</td>', 'my guess is this was taken with a D70s with a Sigma 10-20mm f/4-5.6 EX DC HSM for Nikon and from the clouds in the sky and the diffused light it looks to be taken in Niagara Falls Canada. I think I can hear a couple brothers somewhere around too. I played with this in photoshop alittle bit and put the notes in the comments on the image.  If you want me to take the image down let me know. Oh yeah and if I was completely wrong, ummm oops.', '2006-07-11 00:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
