(2609738, 359822, 22975, '<td valign="top">simple and adorable.  meets challenge perfectly.  i was hoping for some original interpretations that just sat on the fringe of meeting the challenge (but leaning more toward free study).  it''s perfect in my book!  10</td>', 'simple and adorable.  meets challenge perfectly.  i was hoping for some original interpretations that just sat on the fringe of meeting the challenge (but leaning more toward free study).  it''s perfect in my book!  10', '2006-07-11 02:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
