(2609756, 360937, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and idea. I like the colors and texture too.</td>', 'Nice comp and idea. I like the colors and texture too.', '2006-07-11 02:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609759, 360216, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp, capture and clarity. Sky came out great too.</td>', 'Nice comp, capture and clarity. Sky came out great too.', '2006-07-11 02:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609762, 359719, 53316, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.</td>', 'This made me smile.', '2006-07-11 02:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609763, 360961, 57358, '<td valign="top">yeah, I feel like that a lot, anyway, I really like the green color that you have here, I see that you shoved the bill into one of the drain holes, I''d have preferred it just halfway crammed down into the drain so that it weren''t so skinny at the bottom (where it''s going in the hole), I like that you also placed a few coins to add interest, maybe you could''ve done without the leftmost one, I also like your composition, and since it''s advanced editing, you could have darkened up your two spots in the top right corner somehow, overall, nice work : )</td>', 'yeah, I feel like that a lot, anyway, I really like the green color that you have here, I see that you shoved the bill into one of the drain holes, I''d have preferred it just halfway crammed down into the drain so that it weren''t so skinny at the bottom (where it''s going in the hole), I like that you also placed a few coins to add interest, maybe you could''ve done without the leftmost one, I also like your composition, and since it''s advanced editing, you could have darkened up your two spots in the top right corner somehow, overall, nice work : )', '2006-07-11 02:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609767, 361161, 53316, '<td valign="top">Okay, very rarely do I vote on challenges and come across a shot that makes me laugh out loud. I love this - especially, for some reason, the way the bird''s legs are positioned.</td>', 'Okay, very rarely do I vote on challenges and come across a shot that makes me laugh out loud. I love this - especially, for some reason, the way the bird''s legs are positioned.', '2006-07-11 02:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609771, 361121, 57358, '<td valign="top">this is a nice photo, I like the composition and the subtle colors.  You have a really nice soft focus on her face, but I''m wondering what this photo would''ve looked like if the focus were on the candles, this is a cool idea for the challenge and I think your lighting is spot on</td>', 'this is a nice photo, I like the composition and the subtle colors.  You have a really nice soft focus on her face, but I''m wondering what this photo would''ve looked like if the focus were on the candles, this is a cool idea for the challenge and I think your lighting is spot on', '2006-07-11 02:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609780, 361237, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely pale colors, they really look wonderful together.  I like the cool tones.  Lighting is nice, the butterfly is heading towards blow out but you''ve reigned it in well.  Composition is nice, though the right side looks a smidge cramped (possibly because cropping was needed to lose some thistle buds).  The focus looks pretty good but not tack sharp.  Very nice submission.  5</td>', 'Lovely pale colors, they really look wonderful together.  I like the cool tones.  Lighting is nice, the butterfly is heading towards blow out but you''ve reigned it in well.  Composition is nice, though the right side looks a smidge cramped (possibly because cropping was needed to lose some thistle buds).  The focus looks pretty good but not tack sharp.  Very nice submission.  5', '2006-07-11 02:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609783, 361331, 57358, '<td valign="top">cute pic and you can really tell that you put some good thought into the composition</td>', 'cute pic and you can really tell that you put some good thought into the composition', '2006-07-11 02:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
