(2609799, 360260, 53316, '<td valign="top">Looks like a candid except thhe colors are so perfectly matched, and the concept so great, that I think that it can''t be! I''m upping my score for this really great presentation of a candid or candid-like image. PM me after the challenge ends if this doesn''t make sense and you want clarfication :-)</td>', 'Looks like a candid except thhe colors are so perfectly matched, and the concept so great, that I think that it can''t be! I''m upping my score for this really great presentation of a candid or candid-like image. PM me after the challenge ends if this doesn''t make sense and you want clarfication :-)', '2006-07-11 02:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609802, 361343, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice rendition of the challenge.  I like the cool, metallic tones, it really reinforces the technological nature of the image.  Simple but still has points of interest for the eye to linger on.  Lighting looks good though I''d like to see the left side of the image just a bit brighter.  Also, I do not like the border, too thick IMO.  6.</td>', 'Very nice rendition of the challenge.  I like the cool, metallic tones, it really reinforces the technological nature of the image.  Simple but still has points of interest for the eye to linger on.  Lighting looks good though I''d like to see the left side of the image just a bit brighter.  Also, I do not like the border, too thick IMO.  6.', '2006-07-11 02:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
