(2609806, 360999, 57358, '<td valign="top">cool idea, I wish you hadn''t of cut off the leftmost ring (on the side or bottom) or had cropped the rightside one to match at least, maybe a boost in contrast and saturation could help bring this photo out, I really like the angle that you shot from and I like how the top and right side of the pic looks, interesting patterns</td>', 'cool idea, I wish you hadn''t of cut off the leftmost ring (on the side or bottom) or had cropped the rightside one to match at least, maybe a boost in contrast and saturation could help bring this photo out, I really like the angle that you shot from and I like how the top and right side of the pic looks, interesting patterns', '2006-07-11 02:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609814, 360998, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the pretty textures.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the pretty textures.', '2006-07-11 02:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609815, 358508, 57358, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, especially with the solid black background, I wish that your depth of field were deeper, but I like the desaturated look that you''ve got here, very nice emotive photograph</td>', 'I like the composition, especially with the solid black background, I wish that your depth of field were deeper, but I like the desaturated look that you''ve got here, very nice emotive photograph', '2006-07-11 02:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609820, 361139, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice picture, I like the composition - really nice, the only thing is that I wish her skin weren''t so red, I like the vibrant colors of everything else, nice work, 8</td>', 'nice picture, I like the composition - really nice, the only thing is that I wish her skin weren''t so red, I like the vibrant colors of everything else, nice work, 8', '2006-07-11 02:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609822, 360998, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Wonderful black &amp; white image.  I love its simplicity and the tone range is excellent.  Lighting looks great - not sure if its all natural or augmented but it works well.  I wish the focus was uniform throughout and the image seems a bit oversharpened to me.  Still its a wonderful photograph. 7</td>', 'Great title.  Wonderful black & white image.  I love its simplicity and the tone range is excellent.  Lighting looks great - not sure if its all natural or augmented but it works well.  I wish the focus was uniform throughout and the image seems a bit oversharpened to me.  Still its a wonderful photograph. 7', '2006-07-11 02:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609829, 359338, 57358, '<td valign="top">cool idea, though it seems that your white balance might be off, I like that your background is such a soft even color and I like how the edges are soft as well</td>', 'cool idea, though it seems that your white balance might be off, I like that your background is such a soft even color and I like how the edges are soft as well', '2006-07-11 02:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609838, 359829, 57358, '<td valign="top">wow, very pretty, I''m not sure about the border you''ve put, but I like how you managed to get a bird in the pic and I really like your vibrant yellows and oranges, 8</td>', 'wow, very pretty, I''m not sure about the border you''ve put, but I like how you managed to get a bird in the pic and I really like your vibrant yellows and oranges, 8', '2006-07-11 02:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609840, 360590, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good lines and perspective useage.  I like the way the colors work together but I''m not sure I like the shadowed tone of the table/counter so maybe an additional fill light would be better or going through the beer bottles to give an amber glow.  Focus is a little soft too.  I''m not sure if the appropriate white balance has been used (the color of the white/offwhite seems a tad strange).  Composition is interesting but there isn''t anything that really draws me in, no pop or wow factor for me.  4.</td>', 'Good lines and perspective useage.  I like the way the colors work together but I''m not sure I like the shadowed tone of the table/counter so maybe an additional fill light would be better or going through the beer bottles to give an amber glow.  Focus is a little soft too.  I''m not sure if the appropriate white balance has been used (the color of the white/offwhite seems a tad strange).  Composition is interesting but there isn''t anything that really draws me in, no pop or wow factor for me.  4.', '2006-07-11 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609841, 360621, 60141, '<td valign="top">awesome image and great title!  the "10" of the challenge!</td>', 'awesome image and great title!  the "10" of the challenge!', '2006-07-11 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609853, 361209, 57358, '<td valign="top">yikes!  what a setup...  her expression is really awesome and the straight-on composition works really well for this shot, because this is an advanced editing challenge, I might have tried to dodge out more of the shadows of the knives, but nice work overall</td>', 'yikes!  what a setup...  her expression is really awesome and the straight-on composition works really well for this shot, because this is an advanced editing challenge, I might have tried to dodge out more of the shadows of the knives, but nice work overall', '2006-07-11 02:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609858, 358407, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors and simple composition.  I wish the lighting were a little brighter.  The tones - though the red does stand out - seem very muted and sort of drab.  I wish it was a nice sharp black/white to help make that red pop out even more.  Focus is decent but seems sharpest on the board where the black token thingies are rather than on the dice where I''d expect it.  There is also a slight yellow haze to the image in the main portion of the image which might be due to lighting issues.  Still I like the image, I think its fun and it works well for the challenge.  5.</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors and simple composition.  I wish the lighting were a little brighter.  The tones - though the red does stand out - seem very muted and sort of drab.  I wish it was a nice sharp black/white to help make that red pop out even more.  Focus is decent but seems sharpest on the board where the black token thingies are rather than on the dice where I''d expect it.  There is also a slight yellow haze to the image in the main portion of the image which might be due to lighting issues.  Still I like the image, I think its fun and it works well for the challenge.  5.', '2006-07-11 02:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609866, 360588, 57358, '<td valign="top">hmm, wish you could''ve taken a pic of the cylinders, also your crop seems too tight, especially where you''ve cut off the bottom of the bumper.. I like the smooth coloring of the car and you''ve managed to not get any bad reflections and have a pretty nice focus, nice work overall</td>', 'hmm, wish you could''ve taken a pic of the cylinders, also your crop seems too tight, especially where you''ve cut off the bottom of the bumper.. I like the smooth coloring of the car and you''ve managed to not get any bad reflections and have a pretty nice focus, nice work overall', '2006-07-11 02:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609869, 360216, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Has a very surreal feel to it.  The colors are very vibrant and the lighting in the front is interesting.  The cloud background has a lot of interest to it which adds to the surreal effect for me.  I wish the man was a bit more in focus, or at least the 10 on the shirt was more in focus or highlighted by the light to really give it prominence.  Overall I think its a good image.  6.</td>', 'Great image.  Has a very surreal feel to it.  The colors are very vibrant and the lighting in the front is interesting.  The cloud background has a lot of interest to it which adds to the surreal effect for me.  I wish the man was a bit more in focus, or at least the 10 on the shirt was more in focus or highlighted by the light to really give it prominence.  Overall I think its a good image.  6.', '2006-07-11 02:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609871, 361229, 53316, '<td valign="top">I thin kthe highlights on the insides of the shoulderblades detract from the "10" shapes a little bit, but that''s pretty minor.</td>', 'I thin kthe highlights on the insides of the shoulderblades detract from the "10" shapes a little bit, but that''s pretty minor.', '2006-07-11 02:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609875, 360216, 57358, '<td valign="top">nice!  love the sky and the position of both the player and the ball, even the building in the background and the thing on the right of the horizon seem right in place and help balance the photo, nice and sharp too, I''m just wondering about where the lighting spot in the grass came from, but it seems to work, it''s centered and directly in front of him like a spotlight, nice work, 9</td>', 'nice!  love the sky and the position of both the player and the ball, even the building in the background and the thing on the right of the horizon seem right in place and help balance the photo, nice and sharp too, I''m just wondering about where the lighting spot in the grass came from, but it seems to work, it''s centered and directly in front of him like a spotlight, nice work, 9', '2006-07-11 02:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609877, 361199, 53316, '<td valign="top">Freaky title :-)</td>', 'Freaky title :-)', '2006-07-11 03:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609879, 360884, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great underexposed image.  Lots of emotive qualities.  I like the tones, the use of black &amp; white.  I like the feeling it is portraying.  Its a simple image in composition but brings a good deal of interest to the viewer to delve into.  I do wish that all the fingers were visible since they are referenced to as "ten" bars and this is the 10 challenge.  Still disregarding the challenge title I think this is an excellent entry. 8</td>', 'Great underexposed image.  Lots of emotive qualities.  I like the tones, the use of black & white.  I like the feeling it is portraying.  Its a simple image in composition but brings a good deal of interest to the viewer to delve into.  I do wish that all the fingers were visible since they are referenced to as "ten" bars and this is the 10 challenge.  Still disregarding the challenge title I think this is an excellent entry. 8', '2006-07-11 03:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609890, 360395, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The flower does add just the right amount of fun.  I like how the speed limit sign is brighter than the rest of the image, it helps play up the dreariness.  I do think it might be a bit more powerful if the image was cropped more on the left.  Cropping out that left most home/garage thingie would compact the image a bit more and give just that much more emphasis on the sign.  Focus looks good.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Interesting image.  The flower does add just the right amount of fun.  I like how the speed limit sign is brighter than the rest of the image, it helps play up the dreariness.  I do think it might be a bit more powerful if the image was cropped more on the left.  Cropping out that left most home/garage thingie would compact the image a bit more and give just that much more emphasis on the sign.  Focus looks good.  I gave a 6.', '2006-07-11 03:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609901, 360896, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fun idea.  I like the lighting even though it may be a bit too bright on the front most almonds.  I like the use of the mirror which gives it more depth.  Focus looks good and composition is nice.  I wish the perspective were different, if it was from just a smidge higher so you could get the full impact of the top line of the "E".  I think a fuller view of the word would add more interest and give greater impact.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Fun idea.  I like the lighting even though it may be a bit too bright on the front most almonds.  I like the use of the mirror which gives it more depth.  Focus looks good and composition is nice.  I wish the perspective were different, if it was from just a smidge higher so you could get the full impact of the top line of the "E".  I think a fuller view of the word would add more interest and give greater impact.  I gave a 6.', '2006-07-11 03:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609912, 359217, 11923, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge very well.  I think the lighting is perfect but I don''t like the use of soft focus (not sure if it was purposeful or not).  I think in this case I''d prefer something sharper.  I also wish there were more paintbrushes to fill in the area with the grey tray thingie in the bottom left corner or that it was cropped out.  I find myself scrolling the page to remove it from the image I see and definitely liking that better.  Nicely done. 5.</td>', 'Meets the challenge very well.  I think the lighting is perfect but I don''t like the use of soft focus (not sure if it was purposeful or not).  I think in this case I''d prefer something sharper.  I also wish there were more paintbrushes to fill in the area with the grey tray thingie in the bottom left corner or that it was cropped out.  I find myself scrolling the page to remove it from the image I see and definitely liking that better.  Nicely done. 5.', '2006-07-11 03:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609940, 359864, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the light, the pose and the use of the butterflies.  In some parts it looks as if it may be a tattooed line.  I think playing that up and then as it went up having the butterflies look as if they were flying off her back would''ve been interesting.  That said I like the lines of the spine and the lovely butterfly colors contrasting to the glowing skin.  I wish the side of the face were more shadowed so the attention would be competely on the back and butterflies (as is the light catching the face draws my attention away).  Finally, I''m not really liking the way the ribs show, it has a horizontal line to it that takes away from the curved vertical line of the back in a displeasing manner.  Overall I gave a 7</td>', 'I love the light, the pose and the use of the butterflies.  In some parts it looks as if it may be a tattooed line.  I think playing that up and then as it went up having the butterflies look as if they were flying off her back would''ve been interesting.  That said I like the lines of the spine and the lovely butterfly colors contrasting to the glowing skin.  I wish the side of the face were more shadowed so the attention would be competely on the back and butterflies (as is the light catching the face draws my attention away).  Finally, I''m not really liking the way the ribs show, it has a horizontal line to it that takes away from the curved vertical line of the back in a displeasing manner.  Overall I gave a 7', '2006-07-11 03:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2609962, 360937, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great image.  The detail is excellent and the red really jumps out from the dark background.  The flame adds the extra something that draws attention to the the image.  Well done. 9.</td>', 'Great image.  The detail is excellent and the red really jumps out from the dark background.  The flame adds the extra something that draws attention to the the image.  Well done. 9.', '2006-07-11 03:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610099, 360216, 52288, '<td valign="top">i like the light reflecting in the gras, as there would be a match going on and in fits with the expressions of the guy</td>', 'i like the light reflecting in the gras, as there would be a match going on and in fits with the expressions of the guy', '2006-07-11 05:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
