(2617368, 360891, 53316, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the title was an attempt to shoehorn this into the 10 theme. But I thought, with something obviously set-up like this, why not just include ten marbles? - and after looking at the photo more, I realized the reflections obviously made it ten spheres. I just wish that your title had said something more to that effect? But really, I am glad that I am seeing how this meets the challenge because it is a gorgeous abstract image and I love the photo to death.</td>', 'At first I thought the title was an attempt to shoehorn this into the 10 theme. But I thought, with something obviously set-up like this, why not just include ten marbles? - and after looking at the photo more, I realized the reflections obviously made it ten spheres. I just wish that your title had said something more to that effect? But really, I am glad that I am seeing how this meets the challenge because it is a gorgeous abstract image and I love the photo to death.', '2006-07-13 01:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617369, 361273, 33672, '<td valign="top">Looks over saturated to me. I like the stacked comp and texture.</td>', 'Looks over saturated to me. I like the stacked comp and texture.', '2006-07-13 01:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
