(2617376, 360956, 33672, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet effective and well executed.Comp and perspective make this photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Simple, yet effective and well executed.Comp and perspective make this photo. Nice job.', '2006-07-13 01:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617380, 361229, 33672, '<td valign="top">I knew there would be this interpretation. Nice lighting subject and filter work.</td>', 'I knew there would be this interpretation. Nice lighting subject and filter work.', '2006-07-13 01:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617383, 360990, 53316, '<td valign="top">Eee! Very unexpected as I came across this in voting! A great shot. The orange is just the right color to me.</td>', 'Eee! Very unexpected as I came across this in voting! A great shot. The orange is just the right color to me.', '2006-07-13 01:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617385, 360941, 53316, '<td valign="top">*blink* Wow, this is very unique and awesome.  I wish the building looked more interesting/beautiful inherently BUT that does not at all detract from my vote.</td>', '*blink* Wow, this is very unique and awesome.  I wish the building looked more interesting/beautiful inherently BUT that does not at all detract from my vote.', '2006-07-13 01:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617392, 361168, 53316, '<td valign="top">This looks so much like a magazine ad (which is good) except for the bottom right.  So I would prefer a shirt that covered more.  But - that doesn''t really detract from my vote as I do think you have a very interesting perspective/angle. ... Oh. I see now how you might mean that the person listening to the song is "a 10" in which case the lower right makes perfect sense to include... It just does not come to my mind first that a person would be listening to a song about themselves.  In any case, like I said, it does not detract from the vote.</td>', 'This looks so much like a magazine ad (which is good) except for the bottom right.  So I would prefer a shirt that covered more.  But - that doesn''t really detract from my vote as I do think you have a very interesting perspective/angle. ... Oh. I see now how you might mean that the person listening to the song is "a 10" in which case the lower right makes perfect sense to include... It just does not come to my mind first that a person would be listening to a song about themselves.  In any case, like I said, it does not detract from the vote.', '2006-07-13 02:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
