(2619657, 361075, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the soft focus effect at all - it makes the feet look plastic (perhaps they are!) but I like the idea and the composition and colour contrasts very much!</td>', 'Not keen on the soft focus effect at all - it makes the feet look plastic (perhaps they are!) but I like the idea and the composition and colour contrasts very much!', '2006-07-13 17:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
