(2621833, 361177, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like this black and white.  I think the soft focus really adds to the mood.  Clever title, too.  Part of me wishes you had clones out the air coditioner on the left, but part of me says that it just goes along with the plastic chairs and $10.00 reading.  Good work.</td>', 'I really like this black and white.  I think the soft focus really adds to the mood.  Clever title, too.  Part of me wishes you had clones out the air coditioner on the left, but part of me says that it just goes along with the plastic chairs and $10.00 reading.  Good work.', '2006-07-14 10:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621836, 359043, 35545, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile, but I get the title.  Clever.  There''s an awful lot of gear cluttering up the picture, but I guess it goes with the territory.</td>', 'It took me awhile, but I get the title.  Clever.  There''s an awful lot of gear cluttering up the picture, but I guess it goes with the territory.', '2006-07-14 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621839, 361321, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and depth of field.  I''l take your word that there is ten of something in there.  (Ten ridges in each berry?)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and depth of field.  I''l take your word that there is ten of something in there.  (Ten ridges in each berry?)', '2006-07-14 10:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621882, 360641, 38032, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Robert Rauschenberg''s pop art.  I like the less literal feeling to it.  For a topic like "10" ... I think this is appropriate since the number itself has ambiguity and vagueness to it. 9 from me.  PS: I''m gonna go out on a limb and say that some people would like a more literal interpretation - I appreciate that it''s not.</td>', 'This reminds me of Robert Rauschenberg''s pop art.  I like the less literal feeling to it.  For a topic like "10" ... I think this is appropriate since the number itself has ambiguity and vagueness to it. 9 from me.  PS: I''m gonna go out on a limb and say that some people would like a more literal interpretation - I appreciate that it''s not.', '2006-07-14 10:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621896, 357578, 38032, '<td valign="top">photographically quite excellent.  Metal is not the easiest thing to get right.  As far a a subject, it could be more interesting.  8</td>', 'photographically quite excellent.  Metal is not the easiest thing to get right.  As far a a subject, it could be more interesting.  8', '2006-07-14 11:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621907, 358393, 38032, '<td valign="top">this took me a second ... Ok 10 seconds.  After understanding that it does actually meet the challenge, I''m trying to look deeper into the image.  The little plant in contrast with the large trees does create a theme of growth and possibility.  Not really sure if the crop on the head is what I would have picked but it isn''t an image-killer.  The back of the chair definitely should be removed IMO the photo would be much stronger.   The lighting is nice and I think it''s worth a 7 since you have balanced tones and hints of symbolism.</td>', 'this took me a second ... Ok 10 seconds.  After understanding that it does actually meet the challenge, I''m trying to look deeper into the image.  The little plant in contrast with the large trees does create a theme of growth and possibility.  Not really sure if the crop on the head is what I would have picked but it isn''t an image-killer.  The back of the chair definitely should be removed IMO the photo would be much stronger.   The lighting is nice and I think it''s worth a 7 since you have balanced tones and hints of symbolism.', '2006-07-14 11:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622177, 360631, 48228, '<td valign="top">Now, where in the world did you find these ten bathtubs..... What a great idea, and I guess that is you in the tub as well.... I really like this one.</td>', 'Now, where in the world did you find these ten bathtubs..... What a great idea, and I guess that is you in the tub as well.... I really like this one.', '2006-07-14 13:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
