(2622964, 359957, 19786, '<td valign="top">I think you could have desaturated the bowl and left the 10 as the center point of the photo.</td>', 'I think you could have desaturated the bowl and left the 10 as the center point of the photo.', '2006-07-14 18:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
