(2623040, 361035, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL...  The most captivating part of this pic is the girl staring into the camera!  I would have tried to crop out the lone knee at the bottom of the shot but that''s a sniglet!  Nice capture.  Love the girl looking back!<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL...  The most captivating part of this pic is the girl staring into the camera!  I would have tried to crop out the lone knee at the bottom of the shot but that''s a sniglet!  Nice capture.  Love the girl looking back!TC', '2006-07-14 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
