(2624698, 359577, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a great picture. its score will probably suffer because it''s not supersharp, but why should a portrait be supersharp? The lines in the background create a dynamic backdrop hinting at the subject''s energy, which here is subdued only for a moment, and also resonates with the creases on her jersey, and her angular arms. Everything is just right, including the crop. 9</td>', 'this is a great picture. its score will probably suffer because it''s not supersharp, but why should a portrait be supersharp? The lines in the background create a dynamic backdrop hinting at the subject''s energy, which here is subdued only for a moment, and also resonates with the creases on her jersey, and her angular arms. Everything is just right, including the crop. 9', '2006-07-15 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624706, 360210, 50695, '<td valign="top">I find the high contrast visually pleasing, particularly all those dark tones. 7</td>', 'I find the high contrast visually pleasing, particularly all those dark tones. 7', '2006-07-15 14:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
