(2624714, 361304, 50695, '<td valign="top">this looks like a renaissance painting of a saint. Saint Bigfoot? The gleam on the floor looks like the sacred light of the Lord''s gaze. The size 10 shoes are the symbol of Saint Bigfoot, patron saint of high heels. The shoes and the vertiginous angle and the prostrate position really do transform your subject. 9</td>', 'this looks like a renaissance painting of a saint. Saint Bigfoot? The gleam on the floor looks like the sacred light of the Lord''s gaze. The size 10 shoes are the symbol of Saint Bigfoot, patron saint of high heels. The shoes and the vertiginous angle and the prostrate position really do transform your subject. 9', '2006-07-15 14:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624717, 360859, 50695, '<td valign="top">it looks like she''s going to roll her like dough! but that''s a perfectly valid effect in itself. 7</td>', 'it looks like she''s going to roll her like dough! but that''s a perfectly valid effect in itself. 7', '2006-07-15 14:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624718, 359854, 50695, '<td valign="top">the birds in silhouette become letters of some long lost ancient language. 8</td>', 'the birds in silhouette become letters of some long lost ancient language. 8', '2006-07-15 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624722, 361239, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice combination of geometry and portrait. we see the individual in the context of society: assigned a number, put in a box. The graininess makes us feel a little sentimental about the shoes... reminding us of our childhood of hot dogs and bowling. 7</td>', 'nice combination of geometry and portrait. we see the individual in the context of society: assigned a number, put in a box. The graininess makes us feel a little sentimental about the shoes... reminding us of our childhood of hot dogs and bowling. 7', '2006-07-15 14:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624724, 360871, 36914, '<td valign="top">Kind of dark, nice candid shot.  The black and white worked well for the subject.</td>', 'Kind of dark, nice candid shot.  The black and white worked well for the subject.', '2006-07-15 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624725, 361236, 50695, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the frenetic lines and the content people, plus the unreal processing. Looks like a magazine illustration. 7</td>', 'I enjoy the frenetic lines and the content people, plus the unreal processing. Looks like a magazine illustration. 7', '2006-07-15 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624727, 358407, 36914, '<td valign="top">And the winner is white. Focused well, subject draws the eyes right to the Dice. Good shot.</td>', 'And the winner is white. Focused well, subject draws the eyes right to the Dice. Good shot.', '2006-07-15 14:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624733, 360871, 50695, '<td valign="top">b/w was the right choice for this simple visual allegory. the prey and predator together, forming a harmonic balance. the cropped cat looks like she''s just about to exit the picture, but she also seems to be circling, so one imagines a spiral, a mixing bowl of the elements of the picture. as your title implies, she is shepherding the elements. 9</td>', 'b/w was the right choice for this simple visual allegory. the prey and predator together, forming a harmonic balance. the cropped cat looks like she''s just about to exit the picture, but she also seems to be circling, so one imagines a spiral, a mixing bowl of the elements of the picture. as your title implies, she is shepherding the elements. 9', '2006-07-15 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2624736, 361201, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice simple arrangement. b/w helps. 7</td>', 'nice simple arrangement. b/w helps. 7', '2006-07-15 14:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
