(2624742, 361035, 50695, '<td valign="top">the girl on top, turning to face the camera is the secret subject of this picture, which gives it a subtle but compelling interest. 8</td>', 'the girl on top, turning to face the camera is the secret subject of this picture, which gives it a subtle but compelling interest. 8', '2006-07-15 14:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
