(2625544, 359871, 31403, '<td valign="top">really narrow DOF makes this feel out of focus - wider aperture with the nose in focus would make this a stronger photo - <br/> <br/>While we''re at it - this feels like a wide angle lens - have fun with it and move her nose to the top of the frame to distort it more - that look is very "in" right now.<br/> <br/>Hope that''s helpful.</td>', 'really narrow DOF makes this feel out of focus - wider aperture with the nose in focus would make this a stronger photo -  While we''re at it - this feels like a wide angle lens - have fun with it and move her nose to the top of the frame to distort it more - that look is very "in" right now. Hope that''s helpful.', '2006-07-15 21:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625556, 361286, 31403, '<td valign="top">red background is completely overpowering this for me - <br/> <br/>I know that green and red are complementary colors, but the frogs look more yellow and aren''t nearly as saturated as your BG.  REALLY GREAT idea, and I LOVE the execution - with one exception.  :-)</td>', 'red background is completely overpowering this for me -  I know that green and red are complementary colors, but the frogs look more yellow and aren''t nearly as saturated as your BG.  REALLY GREAT idea, and I LOVE the execution - with one exception.  :-)', '2006-07-15 21:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625558, 361349, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool shot, wish it were brighter</td>', 'cool shot, wish it were brighter', '2006-07-15 21:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625561, 361016, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful processing</td>', 'beautiful processing', '2006-07-15 21:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625568, 360439, 31403, '<td valign="top">The white in the background really dilutes the attention you really want on your beautiful yellow flowers.  Reframing would be one approach to get rid of it, burning a vinette around the edge would be another.<br/> <br/>Once you''ve done that you can push the brightness a little?</td>', 'The white in the background really dilutes the attention you really want on your beautiful yellow flowers.  Reframing would be one approach to get rid of it, burning a vinette around the edge would be another. Once you''ve done that you can push the brightness a little?', '2006-07-15 21:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625577, 361168, 31403, '<td valign="top">nice composition and excellent B&amp;W tones to draw attention to your subject</td>', 'nice composition and excellent B&W tones to draw attention to your subject', '2006-07-15 21:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625581, 361239, 31403, '<td valign="top">ohhhhh<br/> <br/>just excellent - that subtle creativity and excellent processing for this kind of shot - love the composition - added grain?  Love it too added or not.<br/> <br/>I have serious doubts this will be embraced by this crowd - but this is great work on lots of different levels!  <br/> <br/>I know you were going for the symmetry, but I wonder if it would be stronger if you shot it with the camera tilted so the "boxes" are angled against the edge of the frame - still think this is great 8 for now (8''s are further reviewed before end of voting)</td>', 'ohhhhh just excellent - that subtle creativity and excellent processing for this kind of shot - love the composition - added grain?  Love it too added or not. I have serious doubts this will be embraced by this crowd - but this is great work on lots of different levels!   I know you were going for the symmetry, but I wonder if it would be stronger if you shot it with the camera tilted so the "boxes" are angled against the edge of the frame - still think this is great 8 for now (8''s are further reviewed before end of voting)', '2006-07-15 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625582, 359957, 31403, '<td valign="top">that''s deep - nice creative on this</td>', 'that''s deep - nice creative on this', '2006-07-15 22:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625589, 360216, 31403, '<td valign="top">like this - the hot spot on the grass and the ball are a little bit of a problem for me - but I appreciate how hard you must have worked to get this excellent composition 8</td>', 'like this - the hot spot on the grass and the ball are a little bit of a problem for me - but I appreciate how hard you must have worked to get this excellent composition 8', '2006-07-15 22:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
