(2625866, 359974, 47933, '<td valign="top">You''re gonna get hammered with the, "Oh no, another one of these" votes, but I think it''s great. Good stuff.</td>', 'You''re gonna get hammered with the, "Oh no, another one of these" votes, but I think it''s great. Good stuff.', '2006-07-16 00:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
