(2625923, 360940, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>this is a nice clean shot with vivid reds and I like the lushness of the trees.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>the picture appears slightly crooked which I think throws off a bit.  I do count 10 flags however four of them are hard to see.  Everything seems so far away it''s hard to make out a lot of the detail.</td>', 'what I like:this is a nice clean shot with vivid reds and I like the lushness of the trees. What I don''t like:the picture appears slightly crooked which I think throws off a bit.  I do count 10 flags however four of them are hard to see.  Everything seems so far away it''s hard to make out a lot of the detail.', '2006-07-16 00:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625944, 358530, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I do like:<br/>I think the texture is great in this picture.  I like the colors in the antique feel.  This is a fairly creative use of the number 10.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>compositionaly I don''t like the upper left-hand corner of the picture.  The extreme out of focusness of it looks like a big blob.<br/> <br/>You also appear to have a little bit of sensor dust but I won''t mark you down for that.</td>', 'what I do like:I think the texture is great in this picture.  I like the colors in the antique feel.  This is a fairly creative use of the number 10. What I don''t like:compositionaly I don''t like the upper left-hand corner of the picture.  The extreme out of focusness of it looks like a big blob. You also appear to have a little bit of sensor dust but I won''t mark you down for that.', '2006-07-16 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625954, 361229, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>this is a sexy pic of a lowly model of course.  Very creative to put the 10 on her back.  I like the lighting overall it gives a good feel.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>it looks little heavy in the burning in spots especially around her legs.  The main focus seems to be on her butt whereas it would make more sense to be on her back.</td>', 'what I like:this is a sexy pic of a lowly model of course.  Very creative to put the 10 on her back.  I like the lighting overall it gives a good feel. What I don''t like:it looks little heavy in the burning in spots especially around her legs.  The main focus seems to be on her butt whereas it would make more sense to be on her back.', '2006-07-16 01:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625960, 359648, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>cute family picture at an interesting location<br/> <br/>what I don''t like:<br/>seems a bit too much like a snapshot for a challenge.  The strong highlight on the crayons face takes away from one of the main features of the picture.</td>', 'what I like:cute family picture at an interesting location what I don''t like:seems a bit too much like a snapshot for a challenge.  The strong highlight on the crayons face takes away from one of the main features of the picture.', '2006-07-16 01:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625963, 361331, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>fun idea well executed.  I think the card really makes the picture.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>too dark in the background.  While I like the card I think it takes up too much of the picture.  The person sleeping doesn''t seem like they''re in a very natural position which makes it seem a bit staged.</td>', 'what I like:fun idea well executed.  I think the card really makes the picture. What I don''t like:too dark in the background.  While I like the card I think it takes up too much of the picture.  The person sleeping doesn''t seem like they''re in a very natural position which makes it seem a bit staged.', '2006-07-16 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625972, 361083, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>the beautiful landscape, wonderful clouds.  This really is a great location.  The colors look good and it''s all nice and sharp.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>the vignetting draws my eye to the center of the photo and away from the logs.  Since the challenges 10 I think that takes away from the picture a bit.<br/> <br/>still a wonderful picture though.</td>', 'what I like:the beautiful landscape, wonderful clouds.  This really is a great location.  The colors look good and it''s all nice and sharp. What I don''t like:the vignetting draws my eye to the center of the photo and away from the logs.  Since the challenges 10 I think that takes away from the picture a bit. still a wonderful picture though.', '2006-07-16 01:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625974, 359186, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>I like the set up, much more interesting than your typical money shot.the lighting works very well.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>I think you could use a bit more depth of field.  My eye is drawn to the upper left-hand corner where things are out of focus.</td>', 'what I like:I like the set up, much more interesting than your typical money shot.the lighting works very well. What I don''t like:I think you could use a bit more depth of field.  My eye is drawn to the upper left-hand corner where things are out of focus.', '2006-07-16 01:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625980, 361290, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>the picture is nice and sharp and the lighting doesn''t seem too bad.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>overall the picture seems a bit too bland for me.  Some of the details on the coin are hard to make out and the way the bill is folded makes it a little bit confusing.</td>', 'what I like:the picture is nice and sharp and the lighting doesn''t seem too bad. What I don''t like:overall the picture seems a bit too bland for me.  Some of the details on the coin are hard to make out and the way the bill is folded makes it a little bit confusing.', '2006-07-16 01:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625986, 360166, 37053, '<td valign="top">what I like:<br/>I think you captured this at just the right moment with the corner of the bill well lit.  The fire is well exposed.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: <br/>I would have preferred a more interesting background.</td>', 'what I like:I think you captured this at just the right moment with the corner of the bill well lit.  The fire is well exposed. What I don''t like: I would have preferred a more interesting background.', '2006-07-16 01:26:39.000000', NULL, 1);
