(2626091, 361306, 12243, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Wow if you drank that much you must be a tad messy by now lol</td>', 'I like this one. Wow if you drank that much you must be a tad messy by now lol', '2006-07-16 02:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626096, 361232, 31403, '<td valign="top">if there are people telling you the DOF is too shallow - tell them to shut up cause I LOVE this kind of photography.  So you and I are right and they are dumb.  (look at Hannah in my portfolio and the un-enlightened comments my beautiful shallow DOF received!)  :-)<br/> <br/>Love this - did I mention that?  It makes me feel - great composition - 9</td>', 'if there are people telling you the DOF is too shallow - tell them to shut up cause I LOVE this kind of photography.  So you and I are right and they are dumb.  (look at Hannah in my portfolio and the un-enlightened comments my beautiful shallow DOF received!)  :-) Love this - did I mention that?  It makes me feel - great composition - 9', '2006-07-16 02:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
