(2628539, 361273, 48890, '<td valign="top">Don, I gave this a 7, because I didn''t get the connection to the challenge: otherwise it would have ben an 8.  Now I see that I should have just counted the stones, so I guess I was a bit dense when first viewing this. :(<br/> <br/>The unusual crop of this picture made it really stand out of the rest in the challenge - it''s very fresh.  I liked the colours, but I think that you may have overexposed a little bit: the second stone from the top looks like it''s missing most of the detail.<br/> <br/>Overall, a very nice ornamental picture.</td>', 'Don, I gave this a 7, because I didn''t get the connection to the challenge: otherwise it would have ben an 8.  Now I see that I should have just counted the stones, so I guess I was a bit dense when first viewing this. :( The unusual crop of this picture made it really stand out of the rest in the challenge - it''s very fresh.  I liked the colours, but I think that you may have overexposed a little bit: the second stone from the top looks like it''s missing most of the detail. Overall, a very nice ornamental picture.', '2006-07-17 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
