(2629213, 357523, 61215, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by boomtap:</b></div><hr/><i> The first thing I think of when I saw this was that you were hiding from them.  Is that the case? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, it''s just the way the land rolls in the park. I was walking up towards this road when I saw them passing by. Just behind them is a turn where they came from, so from my vantage point I wouldn''t have been really able to capture a large group head on.</td>', 'Originally posted by boomtap: The first thing I think of when I saw this was that you were hiding from them.  Is that the case?   No, it''s just the way the land rolls in the park. I was walking up towards this road when I saw them passing by. Just behind them is a turn where they came from, so from my vantage point I wouldn''t have been really able to capture a large group head on.', '2006-07-17 09:29:09.000000', NULL, 0),
