(2629319, 361134, 46314, '<td valign="top">Although you marked my comment as helpful, it really wasn''t. I apologise - it was late at night when I voted and my internet connection was acting up, so I just wasn''t in the mood for typing out decent comments...<br/> <br/>So here goes: I really like this picture. The subject is in sharp focus, and neatly separated from the blurred background - so good DOF. <br/>I also like the way the background forms bands of colours. <br/>The brightly coloured subject over those bands of colour really sticks out well.<br/>There is also a great sense of movement in the shot, and the ball suspended in mid-air creates a great sense of anticipation.<br/> <br/>The only thing I''d criticise in the context of the challenge was that it doesn''t really scream the concept "10" out to me. Sure, he has a 10 on his jersey, but there''s not much emphasis on that. It isn''t central to the image.<br/> <br/>Still, great photo.<br/>However, I re-iterate my question... Who is he? That''s a Brazil kit, but that ain''t no Brazilian...</td>', 'Although you marked my comment as helpful, it really wasn''t. I apologise - it was late at night when I voted and my internet connection was acting up, so I just wasn''t in the mood for typing out decent comments... So here goes: I really like this picture. The subject is in sharp focus, and neatly separated from the blurred background - so good DOF. I also like the way the background forms bands of colours. The brightly coloured subject over those bands of colour really sticks out well.There is also a great sense of movement in the shot, and the ball suspended in mid-air creates a great sense of anticipation. The only thing I''d criticise in the context of the challenge was that it doesn''t really scream the concept "10" out to me. Sure, he has a 10 on his jersey, but there''s not much emphasis on that. It isn''t central to the image. Still, great photo.However, I re-iterate my question... Who is he? That''s a Brazil kit, but that ain''t no Brazilian...', '2006-07-17 10:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
