(2631790, 360751, 60165, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pottersclay75:</b></div><hr/><i> I had to come back and commment again.  It was really odd that I just re-watched The Birds just before the challenge started.  I hope you intended the Bodega Bay connection. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am so sorry to disappoint you :-)<br/> <br/>I have not seen that movie, but I know of it. I just happened to be in Bodega bay, and I took some pictures. This picture had 10 birds in it, hence ... but I could just lie and pretend it was intended ... hehe<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by pottersclay75: I had to come back and commment again.  It was really odd that I just re-watched The Birds just before the challenge started.  I hope you intended the Bodega Bay connection.   I am so sorry to disappoint you :-) I have not seen that movie, but I know of it. I just happened to be in Bodega bay, and I took some pictures. This picture had 10 birds in it, hence ... but I could just lie and pretend it was intended ... hehe ', '2006-07-18 00:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
