(2631996, 360164, 60862, '<td valign="top">I prefer the original.  But then, I think I prefer bright images to darker ones.<br/> <br/>I would also like to see both dice in frame.<br/> <br/>But my main concern is the lack of context.  I agree with Raish''s many questions - what do these dice convey?<br/> <br/>If there''s no meaning to having rolled two of them, then I think I would''ve preferred a square crop around one.  Make that the sole subject.</td>', 'I prefer the original.  But then, I think I prefer bright images to darker ones. I would also like to see both dice in frame. But my main concern is the lack of context.  I agree with Raish''s many questions - what do these dice convey? If there''s no meaning to having rolled two of them, then I think I would''ve preferred a square crop around one.  Make that the sole subject.', '2006-07-18 02:21:49.000000', NULL, 0),
