(2632331, 360260, 22301, '<td valign="top">This pic was way underated! It was in fact the only ten I gave out the whole challenge, even if the voters didn''t agree that ten years was abit of a stretch you had ten drinks and cheeses. I commend you for the thought and set up in this photo, especially how you captured the awkwardness of the people. sometimes I don''t what people are looking for in a challenge but I know I thought this was spot on and the best thing I saw, goin in favs.</td>', 'This pic was way underated! It was in fact the only ten I gave out the whole challenge, even if the voters didn''t agree that ten years was abit of a stretch you had ten drinks and cheeses. I commend you for the thought and set up in this photo, especially how you captured the awkwardness of the people. sometimes I don''t what people are looking for in a challenge but I know I thought this was spot on and the best thing I saw, goin in favs.', '2006-07-18 05:56:52.000000', NULL, 0),
