(2659607, 361353, 14614, '<td valign="top">didn''t vote in this one but this would have garnered a 7 from me.  I like the boldness of the x, it is off-set by your trademark soft hues.  The glass/plastic edge is a great element.  I do agree with the comment on the loss of detail towards the bottom.  It doesn''t balance out the inteest created by the other three edges.  My favorite aspect is that each element is slightly off-center -- inspired.</td>', 'didn''t vote in this one but this would have garnered a 7 from me.  I like the boldness of the x, it is off-set by your trademark soft hues.  The glass/plastic edge is a great element.  I do agree with the comment on the loss of detail towards the bottom.  It doesn''t balance out the inteest created by the other three edges.  My favorite aspect is that each element is slightly off-center -- inspired.', '2006-07-25 19:35:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2662115, 359822, 48560, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful, wonderful shot, Manny.<br/>I have to put this to you - your people portraits are superb!<br/>GuGi said something that I''d like to second, quote below,<br/> <br/>"You have what it takes to make people open up without the photographs becoming an invastion of their privacy"<br/> <br/>good words, and very apt! Good work there.</td>', 'this is a wonderful, wonderful shot, Manny.I have to put this to you - your people portraits are superb!GuGi said something that I''d like to second, quote below, "You have what it takes to make people open up without the photographs becoming an invastion of their privacy" good words, and very apt! Good work there.', '2006-07-26 06:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2668441, 359871, 17851, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful portrait, I love the softess and focus!, I also love her expression!.. maybe you could crop part of the top of the hat?..either way its gonna look great in your living room ;)</td>', 'This is a really beautiful portrait, I love the softess and focus!, I also love her expression!.. maybe you could crop part of the top of the hat?..either way its gonna look great in your living room ;)', '2006-07-27 16:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2668507, 359871, 40679, '<td valign="top">I always like portraits with this point of view. focus and DoF is good.<br/>maybe center her a bit to make it more symmetric, but I''m not sure if that''s what you like? a small crop on the right would do good for this photo I think. <br/>when doding/burning eyes you might keep it the same level, her left eye is a bit darker then the other one.</td>', 'I always like portraits with this point of view. focus and DoF is good.maybe center her a bit to make it more symmetric, but I''m not sure if that''s what you like? a small crop on the right would do good for this photo I think. when doding/burning eyes you might keep it the same level, her left eye is a bit darker then the other one.', '2006-07-27 16:43:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2670786, 359829, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now this is very clever!  Well-executed, too.  Lovely colors in the sunrise and the black really accentuates that.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Now this is very clever!  Well-executed, too.  Lovely colors in the sunrise and the black really accentuates that.  Nicely done!', '2006-07-28 07:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2671086, 359719, 17851, '<td valign="top">lol thats cute :)..composition and the focus of dad and his girl is perfect. Only thing I would change is not cutting of the 10th duckie ;)..</td>', 'lol thats cute :)..composition and the focus of dad and his girl is perfect. Only thing I would change is not cutting of the 10th duckie ;)..', '2006-07-28 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2671998, 359719, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is funny! <br/>was there a reason you''ve cut off the 10th ducky? <br/>the DoF looks very nice and the colors really pop out.</td>', 'this is funny! was there a reason you''ve cut off the 10th ducky? the DoF looks very nice and the colors really pop out.', '2006-07-28 17:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2672006, 359719, 56797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by biteme:</b></div><hr/><i> this is funny! <br/>was there a reason you''ve cut off the 10th ducky? <br/>the DoF looks very nice and the colors really pop out. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, because they barely fit in the light tent so my choices were to squish him up against the others or expose the corners of the light tent. I didn''t actually think people would notice that much since the focus was on the other side of the photo. but I guess I was wrong. lol. live and learn :)</td>', 'Originally posted by biteme: this is funny! was there a reason you''ve cut off the 10th ducky? the DoF looks very nice and the colors really pop out.   Yeah, because they barely fit in the light tent so my choices were to squish him up against the others or expose the corners of the light tent. I didn''t actually think people would notice that much since the focus was on the other side of the photo. but I guess I was wrong. lol. live and learn :)', '2006-07-28 17:25:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2680236, 359822, 54778, '<td valign="top">Ahh! but the challenge would have been if you''d sat down to count teeth.<br/>Very very lovely shot. Full of energy and warmth..</td>', 'Ahh! but the challenge would have been if you''d sat down to count teeth.Very very lovely shot. Full of energy and warmth..', '2006-07-31 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2681739, 360281, 22301, '<td valign="top">Sandy,<br/>Thanks for your comment on my on the beach photo I thought I would return the comment. Congratulations on your ribbon!! Hard to come up with anything I would change. Its really nice that you got a photo with personal mean to also place so high. Very well done. Thanks again for your comment.<br/> <br/>joe</td>', 'Sandy,Thanks for your comment on my on the beach photo I thought I would return the comment. Congratulations on your ribbon!! Hard to come up with anything I would change. Its really nice that you got a photo with personal mean to also place so high. Very well done. Thanks again for your comment. joe', '2006-07-31 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2685899, 360903, 29770, '<td valign="top">I started to name this image with some reference to Spinal Tap and this amp only going to 10.  I wasn''t sure how many would get the reference though.  I tried probably 20 different angles to get the 10''s to show up more predominately, but nothing else worked very well or was just a picture of some knobs set on 10.  <br/> <br/>Thanks for the votes and especially thanks for all that left a comment.  <br/> <br/>Oh, and yeah, my other amp goes to 11, but that would have gotten me a DNMC.  :)</td>', 'I started to name this image with some reference to Spinal Tap and this amp only going to 10.  I wasn''t sure how many would get the reference though.  I tried probably 20 different angles to get the 10''s to show up more predominately, but nothing else worked very well or was just a picture of some knobs set on 10.   Thanks for the votes and especially thanks for all that left a comment.   Oh, and yeah, my other amp goes to 11, but that would have gotten me a DNMC.  :)', '2006-08-02 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
